{{!
    @template aiplacement_modgen/structure_guard_overlay

    Covers a Flexible sections course page while a section change is saved. Once it is saved the
    spinner gives way to a tick in a circle, drawn in, and the cover closes itself.

    The cover itself takes focus, at once, so focus is never left on the page made inert behind it.
    Screen readers hear what the card says through the announce region, filled in once the card shows.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - Short heading: what is happening
    * message - One line on what to expect or do

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Saving your changes",
        "message": "Large sections can take a minute or two. Keep this page open, and you can carry on editing as soon as it's done."
    }
}}
<div class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard" data-region="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard" tabindex="-1">
    {{! Empty until the card shows: a live region is only read out reliably once it is already on the page. }}
    <div class="sr-only" data-region="announce" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>
    <div class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__card" data-region="card">
        <div class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__body">
            <div class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="spinner-border text-primary aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__spinner"></div>
                <svg class="text-primary aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__done" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                     fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                     focusable="false">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9.25"/>
                    <path class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__tick" d="M7.75 12.25l2.75 2.75 5.75-6" pathLength="1"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <p class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__title" data-region="title">{{title}}</p>
            <p class="aiplacement-modgen-structure-guard__message" data-region="message">{{message}}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
